com.weavric:weavric-reliability 2.1.1 发布, Reliability primitives for Weavric: execution guard, retry-with-backoff,
        try/catch/finally, and dead-letter routing — cross-cutting per-block options (__retry,
        __tryCatch) plus wrapper blocks, mirroring the __audit pattern.

